    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPRIME CITY CENTRE RESIDENCE - FOR SALE BY PRIVATE TREATYO'Donnellan & Joyce are delighted to present this exceptional and rare opportunity to acquire a well configured corner dwelling within the established area of Saint Helen's Street, Galway City.OVERVIEWLocation and opportunity are the defining attributes of any exceptional property, and 1 Saint Helen's Street offers both in abundance. \n\nOccupying a prime position in one of Galway City's most desirable locations, this unique property presents an outstanding opportunity for both owner-occupiers and investors. \n\nIdeally situated just 500 metres from both the Spanish Arch and the University of Galway, it enjoys immediate access to an exceptional range of amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and public transport.Dating from the early 1900s, the property retains much of its original character, most notably with a section of the historic Old Galway Wall proudly displayed above the main entrance. \n\nThoughtfully upgraded and reconfigured in recent decades, the property is now presented as a spacious three/four-bedroom residence offering a flexible internal layout.\nThe ground floor benefits from dual access together with the valuable advantage of secure off-street parking to the rear within an enclosed forecourt. \n\nInternally, the accommodation is predominantly open plan, featuring a welcoming living area, a ground-floor bedroom and a generous main bathroom. The first floor comprises two additional bedrooms, a bright living/kitchen area and a second bathroom.Extending to approximately 100 sq.m (1,076 sq.ft.) over two floors, this versatile property offers exceptional flexibility and significant potential for a variety of uses.LOCATIONOccupying a highly sought-after position at 1 Saint Helen's Street, this property enjoys an enviable setting in the heart of Galway City, where historic charm meets modern convenience. Benefiting from dual frontage onto Saint Helen's Street and Saint Mary's Street respectively, the property offers significant profile.The property is situated less than a 10-minute walk from the University of Galway (formerly National University of Ireland, Galway), one of Ireland's leading third-level institutions. \n\nThe university campus, together with University Hospital Galway, forms one of the city's principal employment and educational hubs, making the property particularly attractive to owner-occupiers, professionals and investors alike.\n\nFor further details on this property, please contact Shane McDonagh of O'Donnellan & Joyce.\n\n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
